  "noun_readings": {
    "_doc": "words that are also nouns; after a determiner, preposition or number they are read as nouns and not counted ('o manual', 'no final', 'o total de')",
    "_removed_v09": "'real'/'reais' (currency after a spelled-out number: 'mil e quinhentos reais') and 'em produção' ('para produção' is the same setting) gave false reds on frozen suites (fr-008, num-103, h3-num-003, the CLI clean-rewrite case); removed before the holdout run",
